{# Shared avatar (initials circle) representing the current user — used
   wherever their identity is shown (mobile header, mobile offcanvas card,
   desktop bar). Always wrapped in an <a href="/account"> at the call
   site: both the avatar and the display name next to it link to "Mon
   compte", never to the notification centre — the unread-notifications
   indication lives entirely in partials/notification_dropdown.html.twig
   instead, a separate element. #}
<span class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-circle bg-primary text-white fw-bold" style="width:{{ size|default(40) }}px;height:{{ size|default(40) }}px;font-size:{{ font_size|default('.9rem') }};">
    {{ current_user_display_name[:2]|upper }}
</span>
